ator   ·   ✔ Traces in Application Insights" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F1F8F1;strokeColor=#9BCB9B;align=left;spacingLeft=16;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0B5A0B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="852" width="1888" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-banda-practicas" value="Best practices applied (Well-Architected and Microsoft Learn)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F5F9FD;strokeColor=#B7D3F0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=2;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;fontColor=#0078D4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="894" width="1888" height="112" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-pilar-desarrollo" value="&lt;b&gt;Development&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DES-03&lt;/b&gt; One Bicep module per pillar&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DES-06&lt;/b&gt; Hosted agent versions&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;DES-07&lt;/b&gt; Evaluations as a gate" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=13;fontColor=#505050;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="922" width="310" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-pilar-mantenibilidad" value="&lt;b&gt;Maintainability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MAN-05&lt;/b&gt; OIDC per pillar, no secrets&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MAN-06&lt;/b&gt; Traces in one workspace per pillar&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;MAN-07&lt;/b&gt; Policy defaults as code" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=13;fontColor=#505050;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="922" width="310" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-pilar-escalado" value="&lt;b&gt;Scalability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ESC-04&lt;/b&gt; The scale unit is the pillar&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ESC-06&lt;/b&gt; Hosted agent scales to zero" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=13;fontColor=#505050;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="922" width="310" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-pilar-seguridad" value="&lt;b&gt;Security&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;SEG-06&lt;/b&gt; One Foundry resource per pillar&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;SEG-07&lt;/b&gt; No public agent egress&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;SEG-08&lt;/b&gt; A human before delivery" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=13;fontColor=#505050;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="922" width="310" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-pilar-coste" value="&lt;b&gt;Cost&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;COS-02&lt;/b&gt; Actual and forecast cost alerts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;COS-03&lt;/b&gt; Budget per resource group" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=13;fontColor=#505050;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="922" width="310" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-pilar-fiabilidad" value="&lt;b&gt;Reliability&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FIA-01&lt;/b&gt; One coordinator, one writer&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FIA-06&lt;/b&gt; Blob versioning&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FIA-07&lt;/b&gt; Retire one pillar alone" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=13;fontColor=#505050;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1580" y="922" width="310" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-leyenda" value="Legend: Flow step (1 to 9)   ·   Call or data   ·   Validated in Azure (not the Content Safety icon's own check)   ·   Repeated per pillar (×3)   ·   Boundaries (tenant to private network)   ·   Coordinator code   ·   Third party or no official icon" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;fontColor=#505050;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="1012" width="1872" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-pie" value="Icons: Microsoft Azure Architecture Icons (V24), Microsoft Entra architecture icons (Oct 2023), AWS Architecture Icons (Jul 2026) and the Sign in with Google button, used under their terms (see ICONOS.md) · November 4, 2026" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=13;fontColor=#505050;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="1050" width="1200" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="en-pie-derecha" value="Target architecture · technical documentation" style="text;html=1;align=right;fontSize=13;fontColor=#505050;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1296" y="1050" width="600" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
